  "description": "Compile-time strongly-typed ID generation for .NET using Roslyn source generators. Add [StronglyTypedId] to any readonly partial struct and get a fully-featured value type with EF Core ValueConverter and System.Text.Json converter — all generated at build time. Zero reflection, AOT-safe, no runtime overhead. Supports Guid, int, long, and string backing types.",
